!!<*yamlover: $defs: chapter>
Folded block
description: the angle block scalar — yaml/folded joins lines with spaces
- |
  The `>` block scalar folds single newlines into spaces; a blank line keeps a paragraph
  break. It carries the same two sub-qualifiers as the literal style: chomping (`>-`,
  `>+`) and the indentation indicator (`>2`).
